                              "fill": "$text-primary",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                              "width": 640,
                              "height": 280,
                              "content": "I maintained and expanded the platform's web administration dashboard, \ndesigning new functionality and updating existing interfaces as the \nproduct evolved.\n\nI also worked on web versions of selected app features, including live \naudio conversations, recorded responses, and user profiles.\n\nThese experiences required adapting functionality and interface patterns \nto web environments while keeping them consistent with the wider \nproduct.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.399999976158142,
                              "fontFamily": "Averia Serif Libre",
                              "fontSize": 20,
                              "fontWeight": "300",
                              "letterSpacing": -0.4000000059604645
