                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "ZEXg6",
                          "x": 0,
                          "y": 60,
                          "name": "Designing the Evolution of a Consumer App: From Social Audio to Wellness",
                          "metadata": {
                            "type": "figma-import",
                            "nodeId": "1:335",
                            "sourcePath": "1:888/1:330/1:331/1:332/1:333/1:335"
                          },
                          "fill": "$text-primary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                          "width": 343,
                          "height": 200,
                          "content": "Designing the \nEvolution of a \nConsumer App: From \nSocial Audio to \nWellness",
                          "lineHeight": 1,
                          "fontFamily": "Averia Serif Libre",
                          "fontSize": 40,
                          "fontWeight": "700",
                          "letterSpacing": -2.4000000953674316,
                          "fontStyle": "italic"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "Lg778",
                          "x": 0,
                          "y": 292,
                          "name": "Over four years, I worked as the sole UX/UI designer on an established consumer app, taking over design responsibilities from the previous designer. As the product evolved, I designed increasingly complex features, improved existing experiences, developed the design system, and supported a major rebrand. My work extended beyond mobile design to web experiences, an administration dashboard, and brand and marketing materials. I also introduced Design QA into the development workflow to help maintain implementation quality.",
                          "metadata": {
                            "type": "figma-import",
                            "nodeId": "1:336",
                            "sourcePath": "1:888/1:330/1:331/1:332/1:333/1:336"
                          },
                          "fill": "$text-primary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                          "width": 343,
                          "height": 504,
                          "content": "Over four years, I worked as the sole \nUX/UI designer on an established \nconsumer app, taking over design \nresponsibilities from the previous \ndesigner. As the product evolved, I \ndesigned increasingly complex \nfeatures, improved existing \nexperiences, developed the design \nsystem, and supported a major \nrebrand.\n\nMy work extended beyond mobile \ndesign to web experiences, an \nadministration dashboard, and brand \nand marketing materials. I also \nintroduced Design QA into the \ndevelopment workflow to help \nmaintain implementation quality.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.399999976158142,
                          "fontFamily": "Averia Serif Libre",
                          "fontSize": 20,
                          "fontWeight": "300",
                          "letterSpacing": -0.4000000059604645
